<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Shaw Group started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Shaw Group started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Rauscher Pierce Refsnes Inc said Tuesday it initiated coverage of Shaw Group Inc, a Louisiana-based fabricator of pipe, with a buy-market outperformer rating.</p>
<p>--Its 12-month price target on the stock is $30-$31.</p>
<p>--Shaw was trading at 24-12/64, up 36/64.</p>
</text>
